  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Features\n\n* Adds codecs (#247) ([d7322a4](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/d7322a4c40cd20bd3660e60696bd3e7024f8a972))\n* FronStringWithOptions overload accepting either a dedoder or codec ([7ccd3cf](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/7ccd3cf51808359ee95ee47c30261812be829578))\n\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n* Disallow trailing commas by default (#243) ([058bcb6](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/058bcb6e199293f4a77dc4da0e7fa1f4a8fe495e))\n* Handle int64 and uint64 outside of float precision (#244) ([feb96ac](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/feb96ac397da85eed4555888ae88a169af4308a6))\n* Avoid reflection-based `JsonSerializer.Serialize` in STJ backend ([ddcc635](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/ddcc635a7c8e14a7ccac30a9fb6fc296c1dd1632))\n\n### ⚡ Performance Improvements\n\n* Dispose the `JsonDocument` created in `Decode.fromStringWithOptions` (#256) ([4bb2199](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/4bb2199998bf21f361290ec76cf6df09c1805b8c))\n* Tweak System.Text.Json hasProperty helper (#257) ([215d504](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/215d504c424c0d829ede93c308c4f59c545ea3ac))\n\n<strong><small>[View changes on Github](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/compare/7e3cf6576d8ebb5e7655e18dc8ae97ad136cee9b..581fd36fef81aaae62cdde3bf4821d2dcbc98558)</small></strong>",
